# Parent guided tutorials — copy and presentation

## Objective

Driver.js tours in the parent Help FAB must **teach** family portal options on **desktop and mobile/PWA**.

## Copy

1. Substantive step descriptions (2–4 sentences conceptual; 1–2 mechanical).
2. Keys in **en / es / pt** under `dashboard.parentHelp*` (`09-i18n-copy.mdc`).
3. Home is the only `chrome-and-content` tour; other explains are `content-only`.
4. Steps may declare `surfaces: desktop | mobile | both`; runner filters via `useAppSurface()`.

## Architecture checklist (new tour)

- [ ] Catalog / screen registry / selectors / step builder
- [ ] Dictionary keys all locales
- [ ] `listParentTourRuntimeChecks` row
- [ ] Anchors on real UI (`PARENT_TOUR_ANCHORS`)
- [ ] Analytics `parent_screen_tour:*` / `parent_tutorial:*`

